				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$ \begin{array}{l}{S}_m={S}_{bl}+{ks}_{bl}\\ {}{S}_m=m{c}_m+{S}_{bl}\\ {}{c}_m=\frac{S_m-{S}_{bl}}{m}=\frac{ks_{bl}}{m}\end{array} $$\end{document}Sm=Sbl+ksblSm=mcm+Sblcm=Sm−Sblm=ksblm
